      {
        "thread_id": "TH5",
        "thread_goal": "Align on go-to-market narrative, channels, and launch milestones.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M83",
            "speaker_id": 185576,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, I've drafted the Go-To-Market plan in A7. This covers our launch narrative, channel strategy, and proposed milestones for T7. It's aligned with our overall strategy in A1. Looking for your input. @99087 @52126 @263727 @472565",
            "mentions": [
              99087,
              52126,
              263727,
              472565
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "A1",
              "T7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M84",
            "speaker_id": 99087,
            "reply_to": "M83",
            "text": "Thanks. Reading A7 now. The narrative around 'Travel that Matters' is strong and resonates with our target segments. The channel mix focusing on targeted social media and partnerships with eco-bloggers seems smart for an MVP launch.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M85",
            "speaker_id": 52126,
            "reply_to": "M83",
            "text": "I agree, the narrative is great. I can help connect with some influential travel bloggers in the eco-tourism space. The partnerships channel will be key for us to build credibility.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M86",
            "speaker_id": 263727,
            "reply_to": "M83",
            "text": "The plan in A7 is solid. The phased rollout, starting with a beta for a small group of early adopters, is a good way to de-risk the launch and gather feedback.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M87",
            "speaker_id": 472565,
            "reply_to": "M83",
            "text": "When do we launch?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M88",
            "speaker_id": 185576,
            "reply_to": "M87",
            "text": "Based on the 90-day MVP build timeline, we're proposing a launch window in the last week of next quarter. This gives us a small buffer for testing. Does that align with your expectations for T9?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M89",
            "speaker_id": 472565,
            "reply_to": "M88",
            "text": "That seems far away. Can we do it sooner?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M90",
            "speaker_id": 99087,
            "reply_to": "M89",
            "text": "Pulling the date in would be risky. The 90-day timeline is already aggressive for the approved scope. It doesn't account for unforeseen technical hurdles. The proposed window is our most realistic path to a quality launch.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M91",
            "speaker_id": 185576,
            "reply_to": "M90",
            "text": "I agree with @99087. We need to ensure the platform is stable and our partners are fully onboarded and trained. The proposed window is the responsible choice.",
            "mentions": [
              99087
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M92",
            "speaker_id": 472565,
            "reply_to": "M91",
            "text": "Fine. But I want weekly updates on the progress against that date.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M93",
            "speaker_id": 185576,
            "reply_to": "M92",
            "text": "Of course. We'll track it closely. Let's confirm the timeline. Decision: We are targeting a launch window in the last week of next quarter, with specific dates for beta and public launch to be finalized closer to the time.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D9"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "calendar",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M94",
            "speaker_id": 22473,
            "reply_to": "M83",
            "text": "What about paid ads? Is that in the plan?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M95",
            "speaker_id": 99087,
            "reply_to": "M94",
            "text": "A7 proposes a small, targeted budget for social media ads (primarily Instagram and Facebook) but de-prioritizes broad search engine marketing for the initial launch to maximize ROI with our limited budget.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M96",
            "speaker_id": 52126,
            "reply_to": "M95",
            "text": "Focusing on partnerships and targeted social is the right call. It's more authentic for our brand than broad paid search at this stage.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M97",
            "speaker_id": 185576,
            "reply_to": "M96",
            "text": "The primary channels are where we believe our target segments are most active. So, to confirm, we're prioritizing partnerships and targeted social media.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M98",
            "speaker_id": 472565,
            "reply_to": "M97",
            "text": "As long as it brings in customers. I approve.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M99",
            "speaker_id": 185576,
            "reply_to": "M98",
            "text": "Great. Let's lock that in. Decision: The primary acquisition channels for the MVP launch will be strategic partnerships (eco-influencers, blogs) and targeted social media advertising.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D10"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
